    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Rethinking Facial Expression Recognition in the Era of Multimodal Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>: Benchmark, Datasets, and Beyond
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+F">Fan Zhang</a>, 
      
