        Exploring the Utilities of the Rationales from Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> to Enhance Automated Essay Scoring
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jiao%2C+H">Hong Jiao</a>, 
      
