        SteerVLM: Robust <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> Control through Lightweight Activation Steering for Vision <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
